      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْثٌ نَضَّاخٌ</span></b>  <i>A copious rain.</i> S, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْنٌ نَضَّاخَةٌ</span> <i>A copious spring of water:</i> (S:) or
<i>a spring that boils forth,</i> or <i>gushes forth</i> (S,
Msb) <i>copiously.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضَّاخَةُ الذِّفْرَى</span> A
